  <h2>How do we store your data?</h2>
  <p>
    “Converetti” securely stores your data using a third-party software platform “DigitalOcean” (<a
    href="https://www.digitalocean.com/"
  >https://www.digitalocean.com/</a
  >). To ensure extra security, we protect passwords provided by the user using the “hash” function. Please note, other data is not
protected by the “hash” function.
  </p>
  <p>
    For users who create an account, we will keep their data (eg. name, job title, photo, password, telephone number,
    email address) until this permission is removed by the request of the user or when their account is automatically
    deleted by the app (please see below).
  </p>
  <p>
    If the user would like to delete their account on “Converetti” and thus revoke the permission to store their data,
